   "textLength": 548,
   "text": "Millions of Australians are being reminded to make sure their details up to date if they receive a Centrelink payment as a more than $4 billion boost will start hitting accounts from next week. From September 20, more than 5 million Australians will see their support payments increased.\nIt's a good time to check your eligibility for certain entitlements like the Age Pension as well, says Peter Hog",
