   ],
   "textLength": 384,
   "text": "\"We encourage people to double check, to make sure they're not missing out,\" he told Yahoo Finance.\n\"And also make sure you keep your assets and income up to date with Centrelink as well, because we do find that if you don't, you might actually be missing out on a higher entitlement and give yourself your own little increase just by making sure your details are up to date.\"\nRELATED",
